	<strings name="main_menu/settings_select/multiplayer_setup/nhe_options_edit/cap_nhe_options">
		<string text="Halo 1: NHE's maps only: the vehicle set picks\nNHE's mode, as NHE did. On other maps the\ngametype's vehicles apply."/>
		<string text="On Halo 1: NHE's maps: no timers, as retail\nwith NHE's messages. On other maps the\ngametype's vehicles apply."/>
		<string text="On Halo 1: NHE's maps: NHE's talking and\non-screen timers. On other maps the\ngametype's vehicles apply."/>
		<string text="On Halo 1: NHE's maps: NHE's talking and\non-screen timers (its host teleport stays off:\nAE hosts neutrally). Other maps: the gametype's."/>
		<string text="On Halo 1: NHE's maps: NHE's timers and its\npowerup calls. On other maps the gametype's\nvehicles apply."/>
		<string text="On Halo 1: NHE's maps: NHE's training: the\ncountdown, spawn markers, randoms and waypoints.\nOther maps: the gametype's vehicles."/>
		<string text="Stock teams and camera."/>
		<string text="As Halo 1: NHE: everyone joins red and keeps their\ncolour between games, the dead camera stays on you,\nand the match clock counts up."/>
		<string text="Your game only, any map: mutes the plasma pistol's\ncharging hum and the needler's shots, as Halo 1:\nNHE's maps did."/>
		<string text="Your game only: the plasma pistol's charging hum\nand the needler's shots play as usual."/>
	</strings>
